<title>USA: Illinois Central Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Illinois Central Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.65		    $0.59</p>
<p> Net			 40,000		   36,700</p>
<p> Revs		     173,600		  159,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  61,936		   61,979</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 results include pretax gain of $7.0 million or $0.07 a share from sale of investment in insurance company. Q4 1995 results include after-tax gain on resolution of income tax issues of $4.3 million or $0.07 a share.  </p>
<p>			YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.21		    $1.88</p>
<p> Net			136,600		  118,400</p>
<p> Revs		     657,500		  645,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  61,877		   62,885</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full-year 1995 results after a $11.4 million or $0.18 a share charge for refinancing debt.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
